title: The Price of Bread
subtitle: The mark is falling, and the winter is coming.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1920 and month = 10 and crisis = 0 and ending_id = 0
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.inflation += 1;
!}

= The Price of Bread

At Spa in July the Allies made Germany promise two million tonnes of coal a month. The coal is going west, and the cellars of Berlin and Chemnitz are empty. A dollar buys fifteen times as many marks as it did before the war.

Wages are always a step behind the prices. In Wedding the women queue outside the bakeries from five in the morning.

- @control: Form price committees in the working-class districts.
- @wages: Fight in the unions for wages that follow the prices.
- @march: Lead hunger marches on the town halls.

@control
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The housewives of the district will run them.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.e20_bread = 1;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

The committees check the prices in the shops and post the profiteers' names on the walls. Some bakers lower their prices, and others put up their shutters.

@wages
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow, and it wins members in the union branches.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the reformist unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.e20_bread = 2;
RG.district('saxony', {members: 0.06});
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Our fractions put the same motion to every branch: a wage that rises each month with the cost of living. The officials say the employers will never accept it, and the members vote for it.

@march
subtitle: The police will meet the marchers. The mayors may find extra rations.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_bread = 3;
RG.district('saxony', {militancy: 6, repression: 4});
RG.district('halle', {militancy: 4});
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

Thousands march on the town halls of Halle, Leipzig and Chemnitz. In Leipzig the police fire over their heads.
